# Credentials. The live suites read SALON1C_API_KEY / SALON1C_SALON_ID / SALON1C_USER_TOKEN
# from the environment and the values live outside any repository — these patterns exist so
# that a copy made "just for a minute" cannot be committed by accident.
*.token
*apikey*
*usertoken*
*auth-token*
*-token
.env
.env.*
secrets.*
*.pem
*.p12

# Node tooling for the upstream docs cache (scripts/upstream-diff.sh)
scripts/upstream/node_modules/
